# ADR-0001 Repository Structure

## Status
Accepted

## Context

This repository will grow over several months and eventually contain
notes, projects, diagrams, interview preparation, and system designs.

Without a consistent structure it would become difficult to navigate.

## Decision

Organize the repository into

- Fundamentals
- Technologies
- Projects
- Architecture
- Interview Prep
- Documentation

Every technology follows a common documentation template.

## Consequences

Pros

- Consistent
- Easy navigation
- Scalable

Cons

- Slightly more work initially